      "prompt": "A minimalist, high-end portfolio for a principal design technologist featuring featured case studies, awards, interactive dark theme, and contact CTA.",
      "html_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Elena Vance - Principal Product Designer & Technologist</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest\"></script>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script>\n    tailwind.config = {\n      darkMode: 'class',\n      theme: {\n        extend: {\n          fontFamily: { sans: ['Plus Jakarta Sans', 'sans-serif'] },\n          colors: {\n            accent: { 500: '#10b981', 600: '#059669' }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-neutral-950 text-neutral-100 font-sans selection:bg-emerald-500 selection:text-black\">\n  <header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 backdrop-blur-lg bg-neutral-950/70 border-b border-neutral-900\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 h-20 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"font-bold text-lg tracking-tight hover:text-emerald-400 transition\">elena.design</a>\n      <nav class=\"flex items-center gap-8 text-sm text-neutral-400\">\n        <a href=\"#work\" class=\"hover:text-white transition\">Selected Work</a>\n        <a href=\"#about\" class=\"hover:text-white transition\">About</a>\n        <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-neutral-950 font-semibold transition\">Get in Touch</a>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pt-24 pb-20\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-3xl\">\n      <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-950/50 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold mb-8\">\n        <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse\"></span>\n        Available for Q4 Consulting & Advisory\n      </div>\n      <h1 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-6 leading-tight\">\n        Designing digital tools for human curiosity.\n      </h1>\n      <p class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-10\">\n        I lead product design and design systems for high-growth tech ventures. Specializing in AI interfaces, spatial compute, and developer experiences.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Case Studies -->\n    <section id=\"work\" class=\"mt-20 space-y-16\">\n      <div class=\"group rounded-3xl bg-neutral-900/60 border border-neutral-800 p-8 sm:p-12 hover:border-neutral-700 transition\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center\">\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 font-semibold\">2025 • FinTech Platform</span>\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-2 mb-4\">Aether Capital: Real-Time Algorithmic Execution</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed\">Redesigned the institutional trader workbench, reducing transaction latency perception by 42% and processing over $4B daily volume.</p>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:text-emerald-400 transition\">View Case Study <i data-lucide=\"arrow-up-right\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i></a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-neutral-800 shadow-2xl\">\n            <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80\" alt=\"Fintech Dashboard\" class=\"w-full h-72 object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"group rounded-3xl bg-neutral-900/60 border border-neutral-800 p-8 sm:p-12 hover:border-neutral-700 transition\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center\">\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 font-semibold\">2024 • AI Studio</span>\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-2 mb-4\">Chronos AI: Generative Video Director</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed\">Built the timeline-based video generation workbench used by 120,000+ indie filmmakers and advertising agencies worldwide.</p>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:text-emerald-400 transition\">View Case Study <i data-lucide=\"arrow-up-right\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i></a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-neutral-800 shadow-2xl\">\n            <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498050108023-c5249f4df085?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80\" alt=\"Video Studio\" class=\"w-full h-72 object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Contact CTA -->\n    <section id=\"contact\" class=\"mt-32 p-12 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-neutral-900 to-emerald-950/40 border border-neutral-800 text-center\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">Have an ambitious project in mind?</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-neutral-400 max-w-md mx-auto mb-8 text-sm\">Let's craft memorable software experiences together.</p>\n      <a href=\"mailto:hello@example.com\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-neutral-950 font-bold transition\">\n        <i data-lucide=\"mail\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n        hello@elenavance.design\n      </a>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>lucide.createIcons();</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
